# The Flash switch (cavekit-flash.md R10, T-580): plugin.state.flash, the card's own switch and Settings' "Adobe Flash"
# row. Off: on a corpus game's page no plugin instantiates (the daemon's log), navigator.plugins holds no Flash and the
# movie's place says "Adobe Flash is off" (flashOff.xml: a picture there, 8+ colours, kept; it was an empty grey
# rectangle until 2026-11-18). On again (the pref set live, the page reloaded): the movie
# draws: the region changes, then holds a picture (8+ colours; read once it changed, as the corpus game's intro
# fades through black frames: a single read met one in Mojo, round finger-2026-11-17). The page left, the CPU boost the
# movie took is given back.
id: flash-switch
section: Flash
item: The Flash switch off: no plugin instantiates on a corpus page and the page says so; on again, a reload brings the movie back; the page left, the CPU boost is given back
shells: enyo mochi mojo
prefs: jihad.compat.trace=true plugin.state.flash=0
page: http://192.168.1.245:8097/title/bloxorz
kit: cavekit-flash.md R10
wait quiet 'InstantiatePluginInstance rv=0x0' 6
wait content m 10
shoot off
probe off '(function(){var p=navigator.plugins["Shockwave Flash"],m=document.getElementById("m"),r=m.getBoundingClientRect();return (p?"flash "+p.description:"noflash")+" embed "+Math.round(r.width)+"x"+Math.round(r.height)+" typeof-PercentLoaded "+(typeof m.PercentLoaded);})()'
expect probe-has noflash
setpref i plugin.state.flash 2
chrome reload
wait rect m 30
wait content m 30
wait changed m 20
wait content m 10
launch about:blank
wait line 'cpu boost release' 10
